{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-address-residences-dubai-opera","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-address-residences-dubai-opera-emaar-properties-downtown-dubai","about":"Address Residences Dubai Opera is a luxurious serviced apartment development by Emaar, offering an exclusive collection of 1 to 5-bedroom residences in the heart of Downtown Dubai. The project features two sleek towers of 64 and 56 storeys, inspired by the sailboats of the Arabian Sea, and designed to deliver elegance and breathtaking views. Each unit is meticulously planned with full-height windows that frame iconic sights like Burj Khalifa and Burj Lake. Warm wooden finishes and earthy tones add a refined touch, creating a serene contrast to the dynamic cityscape outside.Located in the vibrant Opera District, the development is steps away from Dubai Opera, The Dubai Mall, and The Dubai Fountain, immersing residents in a world where culture, entertainment, and shopping converge. Address Residences Dubai Opera offers five-star hotel-style services, including concierge, and an exceptional array of amenities such as an infinity pool, gym, lounges, kids' club, and landscaped terrace. The expansive podium between the towers houses curated retail and leisure options, making this development not just a home, but a complete lifestyle destination in Dubai’s most prestigious district.","price":2000000,"title":"The Address Residences Dubai Opera","bitrix":{"id":1164,"pf_id":"are.2.634","source":null,"project_id":"The Address Residences Dubai Opera","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Address Residences Dubai Opera","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Downtown Dubai"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/The_Address_Residences_Dubai_Opera_dce1e351db.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/The_Address_